  "description": "Typed, versioned, provider-neutral External Event Bridge public contract surface (W042, W012 convention): the CORE record types a provider adapter or downstream consumer binds to — the sealed external event, the W036-shaped observation intake proposal, the four-class outbound request with its least-privilege filtered payload and projection reference, the typed retry policy and per-attempt delivery receipts, the sealed provider registration, the provider-unavailability record with fallback semantics, the manual-queue work item, and the W010-shaped bridge event record. TypeScript declarations in index.d.ts; JSON Schema projection under schemas/.",
